  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Create — FOOD / MEAL_BASED  ⭐",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/messes/{{messId}}/expenses",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "v1",
            "messes",
            "{{messId}}",
            "expenses"
          ]
        },
        "description": "**⭐ Ei type-tai meal rate toiri kore.**\n\n**Ki kore:** Bazar-er kharcha likhe rakhe. Ekhane **kono share toiri hoy na** — karon meal onujayi bhag mash close-er somoy hobe, jokhon mot meal unit jana jabe.\n\n**Amount string kore pathao** (`\"7500.00\"`) — JS-er float rounding jate taka-poisay na dhoke.\n\n**Expect:** `201`, `shares: []`",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Weekly bazar\",\n  \"description\": \"Chal, mach, sobji\",\n  \"category\": \"FOOD\",\n  \"allocationType\": \"MEAL_BASED\",\n  \"amount\": \"7500.00\",\n  \"expenseDate\": \"{{today}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status 201\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"expenseId\", pm.response.json().data.id);\ntry { pm.environment.set(\"expenseId\", pm.response.json().data.id); } catch (e) { /* no environment selected */ }"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Create — EQUAL (utility)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/messes/{{messId}}/expenses",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "v1",
            "messes",
            "{{messId}}",
            "expenses"
          ]
        },
        "description": "**Ki kore:** Sob ACTIVE member-er moddhe soman bhag kore — server nijei share row banay.\n\n**Poisa-perfect:** 1000 taka 3 jon-e bhag korle 333.34 + 333.33 + 333.33 — jog korle thik 1000. Naive division-e 999.99 hoto.\n\n**`excludeMembershipIds`** diye kauke baad dewa jay (jemon puro mash bairе chilo).\n\n**Expect:** `201` + `shares[]` bhorti",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Internet bill\",\n  \"category\": \"INTERNET\",\n  \"allocationType\": \"EQUAL\",\n  \"amount\": \"1200.00\",\n  \"expenseDate\": \"{{today}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status 201\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
              "pm.test(\"Shares created\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.shares.length).to.be.above(0));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Create — CUSTOM (room-based rent)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/messes/{{messId}}/expenses",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "v1",
            "messes",
            "{{messId}}",
            "expenses"
          ]
        },
        "description": "**Ki kore:** Tumi nije bhag likhe dao — boro ghor beshi bhara.\n\n**Validation:** share gulor jog **thik** amount-er soman hote hobe. 6000 + 4000 = 10000 ✅. Na milele `422` ar bole koto poisa gorme.\n\n**Cheshta koro:** ekta amount `5000` kore dao — `422 \"Shares total 11000.00 does not match the expense amount 10000.00\"`\n\n**Expect:** `201`",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Room rent\",\n  \"category\": \"RENT\",\n  \"allocationType\": \"CUSTOM\",\n  \"amount\": \"10000.00\",\n  \"expenseDate\": \"{{today}}\",\n  \"shares\": [\n    {\n      \"membershipId\": \"{{membershipId}}\",\n      \"amount\": \"6000.00\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"membershipId\": \"{{targetMembershipId}}\",\n      \"amount\": \"4000.00\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status 201\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
