        "description": "**Ki kore:** Expense edit kore.\n\n**Smart behaviour:**\n- amount ba allocation bodlale **share gulo notun kore hisheb hoy**\n- date bodle onno mase gele expense-ta oi maser period-e chole jay\n- **month closed thakle `409`** — age reopen korte hobe\n\n**Expect:** `200`",
