        "description": "**Ki kore:** Expense ta \"void\" kore — **database theke mochhe na**.\n\n**Keno:** taka-poisar record kokhono hard delete kora hoy na. Void kora row hisheb theke baad jay kintu audit-e theke jay.\n\n**`reason` baddhotamulok** — DELETE holeo body pathate hobe.\n\n**Expect:** `200`. Duibar chalale `409 \"Expense is already voided\"`",
